{"page":301,"width":1772,"height":2670,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"8.4 교착 상대 처리 방법 359","words":[{"text":"8.4","x":1150,"y":158,"width":56,"height":22},{"text":"교착","x":1221,"y":159,"width":48,"height":25},{"text":"상대","x":1277,"y":159,"width":45,"height":26},{"text":"처리","x":1333,"y":158,"width":44,"height":26},{"text":"방법","x":1388,"y":157,"width":45,"height":27},{"text":"359","x":1507,"y":152,"width":60,"height":29}]},{"text":"시스템은 세 번째 해결안을 재택하여 교착 상태의 발생을 허용하고 작업을 수행한다.","words":[{"text":"시스템은","x":303,"y":289,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"세","x":443,"y":289,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"번째","x":488,"y":290,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"해결안을","x":560,"y":289,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"재택하여","x":695,"y":289,"width":115,"height":38},{"text":"교착","x":824,"y":290,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"상태의","x":894,"y":288,"width":91,"height":38},{"text":"발생을","x":1000,"y":286,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"허용하고","x":1104,"y":286,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"작업을","x":1318,"y":288,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"수행한다.","x":1425,"y":287,"width":138,"height":37}]},{"text":"다음으로 우리는 교착 상태를 처리하는 세 가지 방법을 간략히 설명한다. 그리고 8.5","words":[{"text":"다음으로","x":365,"y":350,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"우리는","x":506,"y":350,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"교착","x":613,"y":350,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"상태를","x":687,"y":350,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"처리하는","x":792,"y":351,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"세","x":925,"y":350,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":968,"y":349,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"방법을","x":1042,"y":348,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"간략히","x":1149,"y":349,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"설명한다.","x":1260,"y":349,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"그리고","x":1411,"y":349,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"8.5","x":1522,"y":353,"width":46,"height":30}]},{"text":"절에서 8.8절까지 상세한 알고리즘을 제시할 것이다. 더 나아가기 전에 몇몇 연구지들은","words":[{"text":"절에서","x":304,"y":410,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"8.8절까지","x":413,"y":411,"width":140,"heig